              "blocks": {
                "text_KcqjXh": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "enable_custom_font": false,
                    "custom_class": "title use-rosarivo",
                    "text": "<h2>The Tiefling Who Walks Between Worlds</h2>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "center",
                    "type_preset": "h3",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                },
                "text_9JUGag": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "enable_custom_font": false,
                    "custom_class": "c",
                    "text": "<p>In every tale, there’s a figure who straddles the line between light and shadow. Our Tiefling 5e miniatures bring that story to life—creatures born of fire and mystery, carrying both the weight of a fiendish legacy and the spark of untamed potential. These are not mere figures on your table; they are living legends waiting to step into your campaign’s spotlight.</p><p>With curling horns, flickering tails, and eyes that seem to burn with secrets, each Tiefling miniature embodies a heritage of duality and defiance. Whether they slip through the shadows as cunning rogues, command the battlefield with fierce barbarian strength, or enchant the crowd with bardic charm, these figures tell stories of survival, ambition, and destiny.<br/><br/>For the adventurer who craves more than a simple character, a Tiefling offers:<br/><br/></p><ul><li>The chance to explore complex identities, caught between worlds of light and dark.<br/></li><li>The thrill of roles that blur morality—heroes and tricksters alike.<br/></li><li>A tactile connection to a race defined by struggle and charisma.</li></ul>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "center",
                    "type_preset": "custom",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "balance",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                },
                "text_yH4hPG": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "enable_custom_font": false,
                    "custom_class": "hidden-text-1",
                    "text": "<h2></h2><h2>The Many Faces of the Tiefling Legend</h2><p>From the flicker of flame to the shadowed corners of legend, the Tiefling walks many paths—each carved by will, passion, and destiny. Our collection of Tiefling 5e miniatures captures these vibrant tales, each figure a living story poised to unfold.</p><p>There is the female Bard, whose voice weaves magic and mystery, captivating all who listen with songs that echo beyond the veil. The male Rogue, moving unseen through shadows, bearing secrets carved in silence and cunning. And the Tiefling Barbarian miniature, a towering force of raw power and unbreakable will, embodying the fierce heart of a race born from struggle.</p><p>These are not mere tokens on a game board. They are the embodiment of stories—stories of identity, conflict, and triumph. For every adventurer who seeks more than a character sheet, these miniatures offer:</p><ul><li>The chance to walk many roads, from the subtle art of deception to the thunderous roar of battle.<br/></li><li>The thrill of characters who blur the line between darkness and light.<br/></li><li>A tangible connection to a race forged in fire and shaped by resilience.<br/><br/></li></ul><p>With both male and female figures, this collection honors the full spectrum of the Tiefling’s heritage—a rich tapestry woven with strength, charm, and mystery. Discover the perfect miniature to breathe life into your saga, and let your adventures blaze with the spirit of legends.</p><h2>The Tiefling Who Brings Stories to Life</h2><p>Every campaign deserves more than mere figures—they need legends stepping forth from shadow and flame. Our Tiefling 5e miniatures are crafted to do just that: to elevate your storytelling and ignite your imagination.</p><p>With dynamic poses frozen in moments of spellcasting, battle fury, or quiet command, each Tiefling miniature carries the pulse of its character. The female Tiefling 5e bard enchants with every note, while the Tiefling Barbarian miniature stands as a towering symbol of raw strength and indomitable spirit. These are not just tokens—they are storytellers, waiting to weave themselves into your adventures.</p><p>For those who seek more than play, these miniatures offer:</p><ul><li>A gateway to immersive tales that draw every player into the heart of the fantasy.<br/></li><li>Encounters transformed into vivid scenes, rich with magic, strategy, and soul.<br/></li><li>A canvas for your creativity, where painting your miniature becomes part of your character’s unique legend.<br/><br/></li></ul><p>Incorporate these figures into your sessions, and watch your RPG campaigns come alive—each miniature a spark that kindles deeper connections to the lore and spirit of the Tiefling race. With RPG Guild’s collection, every dice roll echoes with the promise of epic tales waiting to be told.</p><h2>The Flame That Ignites Your Legend</h2><p>This isn’t just another miniature landing on your table. It’s a spark—ready to set your campaign ablaze. The Tiefling 5e miniature from RPG Guild doesn’t just fill space; it demands attention. Each pose tells a story: the female Tiefling 5e bard caught mid-performance, her song a spell woven from fire and charm. The Tiefling Barbarian miniature standing tall, muscles coiled, ready to unleash a fury that shakes the ground beneath.</p><p>Subscribing to our newsletter means you’re not just collecting figures. You’re unlocking a treasury of legends. Imagine receiving a free Tiefling miniature that leaps into your adventure, instantly adding layers of intrigue and magic. You get first whispers of new arrivals, exclusive offers, and secret tips to breathe life into your collection.</p><p>These miniatures aren’t just characters—they’re moments frozen in time. They pull your players deeper into the story, turning simple encounters into unforgettable tales. Each figure adds a new thread to the tapestry of your world, inviting you to explore the diverse power and passion of the Tiefling race.</p><p>So don’t just play. Create. With every miniature, you’re not rolling dice—you’re writing legend</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "center",
